{
  "bridge_text": "寒风吹过莉娜的红外套，那棵大树在月光下显得格外神秘。既然我们已经准备好出发，那就让我们继续走进这棵低吟着的古树，看看里面究竟藏着什么秘密。",
  "resume_strategy": "restart",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "在莉娜居住的小村庄边缘，矗立着一棵比教堂还要高的空心树。每当冬夜降临，树皮深处就会传出阵阵低沉的嗡嗡声，大人们总是警告孩子们离那棵树远点。但就在那天晚上，当奶奶没讲完故事就沉沉睡去时，莉娜穿上她那件红色的羊毛大衣，独自穿过结霜的田野，想要亲自去听听那声音的秘密。"
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s1"
}

{
  "bridge_text": "The secret of Mosk's grumpiness remains hidden in the shadows of the tree, but Lina has her own plan to win him over. She stands firm on the step, waiting to see what the fox will do next.",
  "resume_strategy": "continue",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "Lina stood her ground, her eyes bright with curiosity. She knew that even the grumpiest creatures sometimes had a reason for their sharp words, and she wasn't ready to turn back just yet."
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s2"
}

{
  "bridge_text": "Mosk, with his patched green vest, kept his eyes fixed on Lina as the cool air of the tree swirled around them. She stood firm, ready to see what waited below those winding steps.",
  "resume_strategy": "skip",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "text": "Mosk pointed a thin, furred finger toward the door, his expression stern. Lina reached into her pocket and pulled out the last apple of the season, setting it gently on the step between them. This is for the trouble of walking me down, she said softly. Mosk stared at the apple for a long time, his gaze softening. Then he stood up, straightened his vest, and began to descend the stairs without another word."
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "text": "At the bottom of the stairs, the humming deepened into a quiet, rhythmic song. A firefly the size of a robin lay curled on a bed of soft moss, her golden glow flickering like a dying ember. Mosk's long whiskers trembled as he looked at her. She had been his friend once, he whispered, and he had failed to bring her medicine during a harsh winter long ago. He had guarded this tree ever since, too ashamed to face her until now."
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s3"
}

{
  "bridge_text": "While Lina believes a kind heart opens more doors than stealth ever could, she still holds the apple out, hoping to show Mosk that she comes as a friend. Let's see what happens as the heavy silence between them begins to fade.",
  "resume_strategy": "restart",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s3",
