{
  "bridge_text": "With Mosk the fox watching her every move from the top step, Lina stood firm, refusing to leave until the mystery of the humming was solved.",
  "resume_strategy": "restart",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "Inside the hollow tree, a narrow curl of stairs spiraled down into the dark. At the very top step sat an old grey fox wearing a patched green vest. This was Mosk. His voice rustled like dry leaves as he warned her that the tree was no place for visitors, telling her to return home and forget the strange humming. But Lina shook her head, insisting she could not simply forget a song she had not yet heard."
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s2"
